  "rationale": "The retained agenda and the Granicus player title both identify this recording as a joint convening of the Board of Trustees of Eagle Mountain-Saginaw ISD and the Fort Worth City Council (April 25, 2016), not merely staff presentations or a shared venue. Both bodies are proven conveners: the agenda pairs ISD business (call to order by Board President Dick Elkins, Superintendent's reports, Board President's announcements) with City business (welcome and report by Mayor Betsy Price, Reports of the City of Fort Worth, Mayor's announcements). The purpose-built feed fort-worth-tx-emsisd-board-joint-meetings is described as 'source-scoped joint proceedings of the EMSISD Board and Fort Worth Council; original whole recordings retained,' an exact match for this whole recording; per the joints policy, the proven City Council participant also shares the recording in its configured feed fort-worth-tx-city-council. No other supplied feed matches: the opening ceremony is a single agenda item inside a full business meeting with reports and adjournment, so exclude_event does not apply; 'State of the District' is ISD content, not the State of the City feed; and the All Meetings feed's description scopes it to Council meetings produced by FWTV, which is not established by the supplied evidence. Ownership is fully proven by recording-specific evidence, so no body is unconfigured or unresolved."
